@startuml 006-game-mode-framework-sequence
title 006 game-mode-framework：時序圖（只計對錯：結束 → 判定 → 揭曉）

actor "老師" as T
actor "第2組" as B
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "judging" as J
participant "views" as V
participant "AccuracyRule" as Rule

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/mode {mode: accuracy}（preparing）
App -> Act : set_mode(accuracy)
== 搶答（同經典：各組送出、伺服器配序號） ==
T -> App : POST /api/teacher/end
App -> Act : end()
Act -> Act : _require(ANSWERING)；mode.judged -> JUDGING
App --> B : 推播 phase=judging（只含本組 my_submissions）

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/accept-suggestions
App -> Act : accept_suggestions()
loop 每筆未判定的送出
  Act -> J : suggest(answers, slots)
  J --> Act : True / False / None
  Act -> Act : 有建議才寫入 judgments
end
T -> App : POST /api/teacher/judge {question, team, correct}
App -> Act : judge(...)（改判）
App -> V : student_view(第2組)：內容不變
note right of App : 第2組不推送任何訊息

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/reveal
App -> Act : reveal()
alt 尚有未判定
  Act --> App : PhaseError（尚有 N 筆未判定）
  App --> T : 409
else 全部判定
  Act -> Act : JUDGING -> ENDED
  App -> V : student_view(第2組) 加 results
  V -> Rule : rank(送出, judgments)
  Rule --> V : correct、score、最早正確者為得主
  App --> B : 推播 ended＋results（含對錯，不含建議與參考答案）
end
@enduml
